---
import Doc from '../layouts/Doc.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Doc title="Claude and Cowork integration preview — PostDelegate" description="Explore how a Claude workflow can fit with PostDelegate, with hosted connector setup still being verified." h1="Turn a good conversation into content." eyebrow="Claude and Cowork preview" lead="Use Claude to shape an idea, then review the result in your publishing workspace. A direct PostDelegate connector is part of the integration rollout.">
  <a slot="actions" href={SITE.signup} class="button">Create a workspace</a>
  <a slot="actions" href="/mcp" class="button button-outline">Explore MCP</a>
  <h2>Start with the content</h2>
  <p>Work on a caption, campaign idea or post outline in Claude. Bring the result into PostDelegate, attach the right media and inspect the channel preview before scheduling.</p>
  <h2>Direct connections</h2>
  <p>Compatible Claude clients can use MCP servers, and the Postiz foundation includes that interface. We are verifying our hosted authentication and tool behavior before publishing PostDelegate-specific instructions.</p>
  <aside class="doc-note">PostDelegate does not claim an official Claude directory listing or affiliation. The <a href="https://docs.postiz.com/mcp/setup" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">upstream Postiz setup guide</a> is reference material, not a confirmation that its cloud connector works with this workspace.</aside>
  <h2>Keep the final review in view</h2>
  <p>Confirm the destination account, final wording, media and schedule. Review the tools a connection exposes before allowing it to act on your behalf.</p>
</Doc>
